{"id":"wt_c4_05","name":"花儿各有别，何必问出处","des":"金弦之厅的英格薇尔德想要一些特别有个性的花。","des2":"我很喜欢听森林外面的故事！我听说魔爪湖有个大市集，里面有许许多多的花店，那里的女孩子都会用不同的花朵来装扮自己，特别有个性。我也想试试。但我们森林住民见过太多普通的花了，哪有什么个性可言嘛。请问，能否给我带来一些特别好看，有个性的花？我不会在意是从哪里摘下来的，好嘛，好嘛？","type":3,"typeLabel":"委托","typeOrder":2,"subRaw":"C4","subLabel":"黑森林","subKey":"C4","close":false,"reward":{"entries":[{"kind":"money","name":"银币","count":700,"rawMin":700,"rawMax":700,"min":700,"max":700,"countMin":700,"countMax":700,"typeId":"item_00001","icon":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"groupIndex":0,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1},{"kind":"item","name":"黑森林纪念币","count":7,"rawMin":7,"rawMax":7,"min":7,"max":7,"countMin":7,"countMax":7,"typeId":"item_29104","icon":"/Common_ItemIcon/item_29104.webp","quality":4,"groupIndex":1,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1},{"kind":"item","name":"松茸肉汤面","count":1,"rawMin":1,"rawMax":1,"min":1,"max":1,"countMin":1,"countMax":1,"typeId":"item_30050","icon":"/Common_ItemIcon/item_30050.webp","quality":3,"groupIndex":2,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1}],"text":[]},"startLocation":"金弦之厅（黑森林）","startNpc":{"name":"巨木侍女英格薇尔德","id":"cart_at_npc_Yngvild"},"getTask":{"npc":{"name":"巨木侍女英格薇尔德","id":"cart_at_npc_Yngvild","line":"","kind":"cart"},"title":"巨木侍女英格薇尔德","dialog":{"raw":"收集 3 朵魔花花瓣。","isText":true,"name":""},"condition":"完成《守护之道》"},"predecessorTasks":[{"id":"m_4_8","name":"守护之道","type":"condition"}],"addTasks":[],"unlockTasks":[],"unlockStages":[],"steps":[{"index":1,"name":"收集 3 朵魔花花瓣。","des":"金弦之厅的英格薇尔德想要一些特别有个性的花。","type":"getItemNpc","typeName":"提交道具给NPC","reward":{"entries":[],"text":[]},"unlockStages":[],"unlockSuppressed":false,"detail":[{"label":"说明","value":"提交后扣除道具"},{"label":"NPC","value":"巨木侍女英格薇尔德"},{"label":"房间","value":"金弦之厅（黑森林）"},{"label":"交互对话","value":"（提交魔花花瓣。）"}],"dialogs":[{"label":"不满足条件","meta":{"raw":"wt_c4_05_1_n","isText":false,"name":"花儿各有别，何必问出处"}},{"label":"满足条件","meta":{